      "disposition": "rejectedPacketCorrectionCandidateBlocked",
      "finding": "The retained November 15 ThinkApple article says the developer seed arrived 'yesterday' and the public seed was made available shortly afterward. That places the public appearance on November 14, not November 15. The November 15 iDevice.ro and iPhone FAQ pages establish availability by November 15 but do not outweigh this explicit retrospective chronology; the iPhone FAQ body also contains material version-number typos. MacRumors carries a November 14 developer timestamp and an untimestamped public update.",
      "requiredHandling": "Do not approve or create this candidate with appearanceDate 2016-11-15. Restore 2016-11-14 or produce stronger timestamped contemporary evidence proving a November 15 first appearance, then issue a corrected packet for review."
    },
    {
